juta menjadi tiga juta.

7
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:11,027
Toilet siram mulai populer.

8
00:00:11,047 --> 00:00:12,575
Masalahnya, semua limbah

9
00:00:12,595 --> 00:00:13,907
