10
00:00:13,927 --> 00:00:15,600
Thames, di tengah kota.

11
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,111
Saat itu,

12
00:00:16,131 --> 00:00:17,458
orang percaya penyakit menular

13
00:00:17,478 --> 00:00:18,480
