14
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,563
Kolera sudah berkali-kali

15
00:00:19,583 --> 00:00:20,368
mewabah.

16
00:00:20,388 --> 00:00:21,993
Tahun 1831 saja,

17
00:00:22,013 --> 00:00:23,154
