48
00:01:03,985 --> 00:01:05,172
Limbah dialirkan ke timur,

49
00:01:05,192 --> 00:01:06,638
jauh dari kota.

50
00:01:06,658 --> 00:01:07,721
Wabah kolera di London

51
00:01:07,741 --> 00:01:08,619
